{title: Chhap Tilak Sab Chheeni Re}
{artist: Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C] Chaap Tilak sab [G] cheeni re,        moh se [F] naina [C] milayke
[C] Naina Milayeke Moh Se,        [F] Naina Mila [C] ike
[C] Gori gori gori baiyaan,        [F] hari hari chudiyaan,
[C] Bahiyaan pakad har [G] leeni re,        moh se [F] naina [C] milayke
[C] Bal bal jaaun main,        [F] tore rang rejava,
[C] Apni si rang [G] deeni re,        moh se [F] naina mila [C] yke.
[C] Prem bhati ka,        [F] madhva pilayke,
[C] Matwari kar [G] deeni re,        moh se [F] naina mila [C] yke.
